    "P1 step 3: cross-platform reset contract. Tests seed via adjustment-transfer prepare, run the platform reset entry, and observe via the platform transfer capture channel.",
    "expect.values markers: @spec_default resolves to this platform's model.<platform>.default from the spec (mapped to protocol via scale_from_protocol). WB temp/tint use null: the four capture channels emit null placeholders in camera mode, so the as-shot target is pinned by color.white_balance.mode=camera alone.",
    "expect.untouched compares against the pre-reset capture; divergences from current behaviour are ratcheted per platform in test code (knownResetDivergences), never silently absorbed here."
  ],
